{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんこんばんは！\n新内眞衣です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とても久しぶりなブログに\nなってしまいましたm(_ _)m"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"舞台【あさひなぐ】がついに\n始まりました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"稽古期間は本当に学びの連続で\n楽しかったしとてもタメになる\nことばかり！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もちろん体力的には大変だけど\n今日のベストを尽くしなさいって\n言ってくれていたので\n伸び伸びと稽古が出来てたな～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いい時間でした。本当に。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして\n改めて幕があいて..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"紺野さくらという役を\n頂けて本当に嬉しいし\n大切に演じようと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"稽古場にもゲネプロにも\n来てくれたこざきさんが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さくらちゃんは\nナチュラルボーンクズと\nおっしゃっていたので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全力で清々しいクズを演じます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さくらちゃんだと\n何故か許せちゃう\nセリフや行動もたくさんあるので\n小さな動きとかにも\n是非注目してみて下さいね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日で5公演が終わったので\n東京はあと13公演！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"体力勝負！頑張ります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2017/05/23/5026812/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして明日5/24は\nアルバム発売日ということで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46がニッポン放送の夜を\nジャックさせて頂きます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先ずは\n24:00～24:53は\n「ミュ～コミ＋プラス」に\n佐々木琴子・鈴木絢音"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして\n25:00～27:00は\n乃木坂46 西野七瀬のANNに\n斉藤優里"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後は\n27:00～28:30\n乃木坂46 新内眞衣のANN0 (ZERO)に\n斎藤ちはる・能條愛未・和田まあや"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と盛りだくさんな感じです٩( 'ω' )و"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"週の真ん中だけど\nみなさん夜更かしの準備\nよろしくお願いします◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2017/05/23/5026812/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは最後に私服を。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2017/05/23/5026812/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2017/05/23/5026812/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また雑誌に出られたら\nいーなー٩( 'ω' )و"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張ります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よし！短いけどおわり！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また書きます◎\nおやすみ！"}],"source":"archive"}